          "type": "text",
          "id": "FUmdI",
          "name": "2026-09-30 / Final v2 implementation",
          "fill": "$on-surface-variant",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "2026-09-30 · Owner-supplied Design System v2 applied. Pine replaces cobalt in legacy default themes, preserving explicit custom and system-theme choices. Bubble radius 16, tail 4, row avatar 50, metadata column 70. Focus ring 2; scrim ink 60% / black 70%; secondary text uses the contrast-safe variant roles. Shared Android components, 24dp Lucide glyphs, per-filter empty states and 48dp controls. Persian search treats ي/ی and ك/ک alike without rewriting message content. Long press opens the message sheet; Select enters multi-selection. Deletion confirmations remain pending explicit approval to change destructive behavior.",
          "lineHeight": "$leading-body",
          "fontFamily": "$fontBody",
          "fontSize": "$text-body-sm",
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        }
      ]
