          "content": "Tapping a bubble (not its buttons) opens the sheet. The bubble lifts out of its slot to 12dp above the sheet (elevation 2, same 300ms curve), no scrolling; on dismiss it returns. Taller bubbles clip to the free space with a bottom fade. Actions: Copy, Forward, Star/Unstar, Share, Select text, Delete (error colour). Failed messages drop Star and Share; Retry and SIM stay in the bubble. Long press still starts selection (10).",
          "fontFamily": "$fontBody",
          "fontSize": "$text-meta",
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        }
      ]
    },
